<title>JAPAN: Riken Vinyl to issue Euroyen CB.</title>
<headline>Riken Vinyl to issue Euroyen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Riken Vinyl Industry Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible ISSUE NO	   AMT   5.5 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON nil		   ISSU PRICE	 MATURITY 04.Oct.00</p>
<p>CONV PRICE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 21.Oct.96	CONV TO 27.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S		 PAY DATE 04 Oct.96   INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		     SIGN DATE 18.Sep.96  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		     LAST JBRI		LAST NIS</p>
<p>The conversion price will be decided on September 18.</p>
